## 3. Flow Diagram of the Calculation Engine

Here is a visual flow of how the Backend Engine will gather data and calculate the score for a single day:

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[Start: Calculate Daily Score for Washroom X] --> B[Timeframe: Today 00:00 to 23:59]
    
    B --> C1[Fetch 30 Cleaning Activities <br/> from cleaner_review]
    B --> C2[Fetch 30 User Feedbacks <br/> from user_review_qr]
    B --> C3[Fetch 30 Inspections <br/> from review]
    
    C1 --> D1(Average Cleaning Score)
    C2 --> D2(Average Feedback Score)
    C3 --> D3(Average Inspection Score)
    
    D1 -. Apply 50% Weight .-> E{Scoring Engine}
    D2 -. Apply 30% Weight .-> E
    D3 -. Apply 20% Weight .-> E
    
    E --> F((Final Daily Score: 8.3/10))
    F --> G[Save Daily Score to Database]
```

